sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant R as Receiver
  participant M as Manager
  participant DB as SSOT (schema ipm)
  participant P as Publisher
  participant REC as Reconciler
  participant OB as Observer
  participant EX as Executor
  participant Z as Zitadel
  U->>R: GET /v1/ipm/organizations/{resourceId}
  R-->>U: 200 com resourceVersion
  U->>R: PATCH /v1/ipm/organizations/{resourceId} {resourceVersion, name}
  R->>R: valida a role ipm.organization.update e a posse (o dono só altera o name)
  R->>M: requested-update (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 operationId
  alt resourceVersion diferente da atual
    M->>DB: Operation rejected (conflict), nada muda
  else nome reservado ou já usado
    M->>DB: Operation rejected (validation), nada muda
  else aceito
    M->>DB: geração + 1, name novo, outbox desired
    P->>REC: desired (DESIRED)
    REC->>EX: action update (nome difere)
    EX->>Z: UpdateOrganization (renomeia)
    OB->>M: observed com o nome novo (fase Ready)
  end
  Note over R,EX: platformAccess e reconciliation só o operador altera: revoked desativa a organização, granted a ativa
  U->>R: DELETE /v1/ipm/organizations/{resourceId}?resourceVersion=N
  R->>M: requested-delete (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 operationId
  M->>DB: lifecycle absent, fase Deleting, outbox desired
  P->>REC: desired absent (DESIRED)
  REC->>EX: action delete (organização ainda presente)
  EX->>Z: DeleteOrganization (ausente também é sucesso)
  EX->>REC: completed (RESULT)
  OB->>Z: ListOrganizations pelo resourceId
  OB->>M: observed absent
  M->>DB: apaga a linha, Operation completed e publica removed
